{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"弱可缩极限"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"弱可缩极限"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>弱可缩极限是以"},{"Local":{"url":"弱可缩范畴","text":"弱可缩范畴"}},{"Plain":"为指标范畴的"},{"Local":{"url":"极限","text":"极限"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 函子 $\\mathcal C_{/c} \\to \\mathcal C$ 保持且"},{"Local":{"url":"反映(范畴论)","text":"反映"}},{"Plain":"弱可缩极限.</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>. 设 $I$ 为弱可缩范畴, 图表 $X\\colon I\\to\\mathcal C_{/c}$ 的极限是"},{"Local":{"url":"锥(范畴论)","text":"右锥"}},{"Plain":"图表 $\\widetilde {X}\\colon I^{\\triangleright}\\to\\mathcal C$ 的极限, 而 $I\\to I^{\\triangleright}$ "},{"Local":{"url":"共首函子","text":"共首"}},{"Plain":", 故该极限等同于 $\\widetilde {X}|_{I}$ 的极限.</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"Ani","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":" 中的弱可缩极限与"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"指标的余极限交换.</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>. 以生象 $A$ 为指标的余极限操作即为复合函子\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Fun}(A,\\mathsf{Ani}) \\simeq \\mathsf{Ani}_{/A} \\to \\mathsf{Ani}.\r\n$$\n而由前一个命题, 遗忘函子 $\\mathsf{Ani}_{/A} \\to \\mathsf{Ani}$ 保持弱可缩极限.</p>\n"}]}}